  The reel_script says the Coimbatore/Nilgiris heavy rain on Nov 2 is 'ஓரிரு இடங்களில்' (in a few places), which matches the article, but the reel_script omits that the Nov 2 heavy rain is specifically in Coimbatore AND Nilgiris while Nov 2 'பிற' areas get light-to-moderate rain — the script's Nov 2 line only mentions Nilgiris, dropping Coimbatore from the Nov 2 heavy-rain statement.
  The reel_script's Nov 2 statement 'நவம்பர் 2ஆம் தேதி நீலகிரி மாவட்டத்திலும் ஓரிரு இடங்களில் கனமழை பெய்யக்கூடும்' is ambiguous and not a faithful rendering of the article's Nov 2 line naming Coimbatore and Nilgiris.
  The reel_script omits the Nov 1 wind detail (40-50 km/h gusts with thunder and lightning) and the Nov 2 light-to-moderate rain for other areas, which are important facts of the article's day-by-day forecast.
  The slides_spec slide 'நவம்பர் 1' says 'வடகடலோர மாவட்டங்களிலும் மேற்குத் தொடர்ச்சி மலை' — the phrase is truncated and has no clear meaning in Tamil (missing 'மாவட்டங்கள்'), so it is ungrammatical/unclear.
  The caption describes the Nov 1 light-to-moderate rain as 'ஓரிரு இடங்களில்' with 40-50 km/h winds for Puducherry and Karaikal as well, which combines separate facts into one sentence.
