  Reel script says the Nov 1 gram sabha meeting is held on 'Ullaatchigal Dinam' occasion, but the article gives that as the reason for the meeting; this is consistent. However, the reel script states that gram sabha meeting 'நடைபெறவுள்ளது' is part of the Ullatchigal Dinam, which matches; no error there.
  Reel script and slides say residents are 'பங்கேற்கின்றனர்' (participating) at the meeting, while the article only says residents are preparing to raise questions; the claim that they will attend is not stated in the article.
